              FFIIGG__HHAAVVEE__AARRCCHH__TTRRAACCEEHHOOOOKK.

              Permission to access this file is governed by  a  ptrace  access
              mode PPTTRRAACCEE__MMOODDEE__AATTTTAACCHH__FFSSCCRREEDDSS check; see ppttrraaccee(2).

